<title>USA: Amtrol Inc Q1 April 5 net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Amtrol Inc Q1 April 5 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>WEST WARWICK, R.I. 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>For The Quarter Ended</p>
<p>					  April 5,	 March 30,</p>
<p>					   1997		 1996</p>
<p>				     (Successor     (Predecessor</p>
<p>					Company)	  Company)</p>
<p>Net Sales				$45,035	 $41,162</p>
<p>Net (Loss) Income		     ($340)	 $1,939</p>
<p>			    (Unaudited - in thousands)</p>
<p>NOTE: AMTROL said it has entered into an agreement to sell all of the assets, subject to all liabilities, of its American Granby Inc subsidiary.</p>
<p>The company expects to apply the net proceeds of the sale, estimated at between $4.8 million and $5.3 million, to the repayment of debt and to fund future growth.</p>
